<title>USA: IntraNet Solutions licenses software.</title>
<headline>IntraNet Solutions licenses software.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>IntraNet Solutions Inc said Tuesday it recently entered into a marketing agreement with a European organization, which includes the sale of approximately $400,000 of IntraNet's Intra.doc! software.</p>
<p>IntraNet said Westward Digital Ltd of the United Kingdom will buy a total of 22 licenses of Intra.doc! document management software products for use as an internal business tool, and for resale to its customers.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not given.</p>
<p>Westward Digital provides electronic printing, publishing, distribution and fulfillment services to large companies in Britain.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
